sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant SettingsScreen
    participant AppearanceSubScreen
    participant ThemeService
    participant LocalStorage as Persisted preference<br/>(SharedPreferences)

    Note over User,LocalStorage: NOT IMPLEMENTED as a dedicated "Manage User Profile"<br/>feature (no edit of username/email/phone/password/avatar).<br/>Closest existing flow: Settings -> Appearance -> Theme

    User->>SettingsScreen: open Settings ("Preferences" banner)
    User->>SettingsScreen: tap "Appearance"
    SettingsScreen->>AppearanceSubScreen: navigate
    AppearanceSubScreen-->>User: show ThemeMode options<br/>(System / Light / Dark)

    User->>AppearanceSubScreen: select ThemeMode
    AppearanceSubScreen->>ThemeService: setThemeMode(mode)
    ThemeService->>LocalStorage: persist themeMode
    ThemeService-->>AppearanceSubScreen: notifyListeners() - app re-themes

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over User,LocalStorage: Profile-adjacent data with no edit UI
    Note right of LocalStorage: users/{uid}/profile/preferences doc holds<br/>biometricGateEnabled, themeMode,<br/>keyVaultCreatedAt, lastVaultAccessAt -<br/>written at registration / vault access only.<br/>RSA keypair management is covered separately (SD006).
    end
